al.\n          \n          Examples: - `-c model=\"o3\"` - `-c 'sandbox_permissions=[\"disk-full-read-access\"]'` - `-c\n          shell_environment_policy.inherit=all`\n\n      --sandbox-state-json <JSON>\n          Opaque JSON value from `codex/sandbox-state` to apply directly\n\n      --enable <FEATURE>\n          Enable a feature (repeatable). Equivalent to `-c features.<name>=true`\n\n      --sandbox-state-readable-root <SANDBOX_STATE_READABLE_ROOT>\n          Add a readable root to the supplied sandbox state. Repeat for multiple roots\n\n      --disable <FEATURE>\n          Disable a feature (repeatable). Equivalent to `-c features.<name>=false`\n\n      --sandbox-state-disable-network\n          Disable direct network access in the supplied sandbox state\n\n  -P, --permission-profile <NAME>\n          Named permissions profile to apply from the active configuration stack\n\n  -p, --profile <CONFIG_PROFILE>\n          Layer $CODEX_HOME/<name>.config.toml on top of the base user config\n\n  -C, --cd <DIR>\n          Working directory used for profile resolution and command execution\n\n      --include-managed-config\n          Include managed requirements while resolving an explicit permissions profile\n\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n", "stderr": ""}], "sandboxAttempts": 1, "workerPid": 2547, "uid": 22002, "gid": 22002, "groups": [22002], "status": "Name:\tpython3\nUmask:\t0022\nState:\tR (running)\nTgid:\t2547\nNgid:\t0\nPid:\t2547\nPPid:\t1\nTracerPid:\t0\nUid:\t22002\t22002\t22002\t22002\nGid:\t22002\t22002\t22002\t22002\nFDSize:\t512\nGroups:\t22002 \nNStgid:\t2547\nNSpid:\t2547\nNSpgid:\t2547\nNSsid:\t2547\nKthread:\t0\nVmPeak:\t   29304 kB\nVmSize:\t   29304 kB\nVmLck:\t       0 kB\nVmPin:\t       0 kB\nVmHWM:\t   18456 kB\nVmRSS:\t   18456 kB\nRssAnon:\t    7904 kB\nRssFile:\t   10552 kB\nRssShmem:\t       0 kB\nVmData:\t    8836 kB\nVmStk:\t     132 kB\nVmExe:\t    6696 kB\nVmLib:\t    9184 kB\nVmPTE:\t      92 kB\nVmSwa